{
  "vector_id": "DF-LIVEKIT-SESSION-BINDING-001",
  "description": "The document a Channel Provider seals into `ChannelBinding.opaque_binding`, and the exact bytes a Body decodes back out of it. The Authority relays it without reading it; this vector is the agreement between the two ends that do.",
